WEBVTT

00:04:58.459 --> 00:05:00.245
no longer sell appliances

00:05:00.245 --> 00:05:01.684
with one green tick -

00:05:01.684 --> 00:05:04.624
that means an energy guzzler,

00:05:04.624 --> 00:05:06.949
an appliance that is going to

00:05:06.949 --> 00:05:09.920
use a huge amount of electricity.

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:13.160
These methods are advantageous

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.950
to reduce energy consumption,

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.629
but climate change is

00:05:17.629 --> 00:05:19.745
a bigger and more complex problem.

00:05:19.745 --> 00:05:22.820
We need bigger and better instruments.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:27.124
First of all, we should ask polluters to pay.

00:05:27.124 --> 00:05:31.790
Apart from their moral and ethical responsibilities,

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.694
businesses do not have

00:05:33.694 --> 00:05:38.179
any other incentive to stop emitting CO2.

00:05:38.179 --> 00:05:40.039
They are doing business,

00:05:40.039 --> 00:05:42.379
producing goods and services.

00:05:42.379 --> 00:05:44.209
CO2 emissions are

00:05:44.209 --> 00:05:46.850
a byproduct of this process.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:50.299
Nobody produces CO2 purposely.

00:05:50.299 --> 00:05:52.115
While companies are selling

00:05:52.115 --> 00:05:54.290
oil and generating electricity,

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.255
an enormous amount of

00:05:56.255 --> 00:05:59.389
CO2 emission is just part of this process.

00:05:59.389 --> 00:06:02.225
If I were an oil and gas company,

00:06:02.225 --> 00:06:04.070
I will not worry about emissions.

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:06.169
My job is to sell oil and gas,

00:06:06.169 --> 00:06:07.589
and I will do that.

00:06:07.589 --> 00:06:10.505
Why should I try to reduce my emissions,

00:06:10.505 --> 00:06:13.144
if it will cost me a lot?

00:06:13.144 --> 00:06:14.960
Unless I care about

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:17.659
my ethical and moral responsibility.

00:06:17.659 --> 00:06:21.049
However, things cannot be left to

00:06:21.049 --> 00:06:24.680
the ethical and moral integrity of businesses.

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:28.400
The first thing we have to do is we have

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:32.030
to make sure that polluting is not free.

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:34.309
If you pollute, you pay.

00:06:34.309 --> 00:06:36.469
However, we want to

00:06:36.469 --> 00:06:38.630
do it more flexibly

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:42.454
so we do not harm the economy in the process.

00:06:42.454 --> 00:06:44.599
We noted in the beginning that

00:06:44.599 --> 00:06:46.940
we still must grow.

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:50.254
We must allow low-income countries

00:06:50.254 --> 00:06:52.924
to grow their income per capita

00:06:52.924 --> 00:06:54.695
and narrow the income gap

00:06:54.695 --> 00:06:57.019
with wealthier countries.

00:06:57.019 --> 00:06:59.284
Reduction of CO2 emissions

00:06:59.284 --> 00:07:01.624
does not happen free of charge.

00:07:01.624 --> 00:07:05.465
If I ask a business to reduce its emissions,

00:07:05.465 --> 00:07:08.165
they have to spend money to do so.

00:07:08.165 --> 00:07:10.040
They will be required to implement

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:11.120
certain technologies,

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:12.200
probably change their

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.210
production process and do

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:15.604
plenty of other things

00:07:15.604 --> 00:07:17.915
and everything has a cost.

00:07:17.915 --> 00:07:20.794
And because of the same reason,

00:07:20.794 --> 00:07:22.790
we want to ensure that we

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.084
reduce our emissions efficiently,

00:07:25.084 --> 00:07:27.739
which means reducing them

00:07:27.739 --> 00:07:30.695
at the lowest cost possible.

00:07:30.695 --> 00:07:33.859
In short, the government

00:07:33.859 --> 00:07:35.930
must do only one thing,

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.254
which is to make sure

00:07:38.254 --> 00:07:41.524
polluting is not free anymore,

00:07:41.524 --> 00:07:43.789
and then let the businesses

00:07:43.789 --> 00:07:47.189
decide what they want to do about it.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:53.060
If they decide that they

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:55.280
do not want to do anything about it,

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.545
they don't want to reduce their emissions,

00:07:57.545 --> 00:07:59.225
they must pay fines,

00:07:59.225 --> 00:08:02.584
probably in the form of emission taxes.

00:08:02.584 --> 00:08:04.414
Alternatively,

00:08:04.414 --> 00:08:06.289
they can reduce their emissions

00:08:06.289 --> 00:08:09.875
by investing in clean and new technologies.

00:08:09.875 --> 00:08:11.239
And instead of using

00:08:11.239 --> 00:08:14.254
fossil fuels, use clean energy.

00:08:14.254 --> 00:08:16.310
Another option would be to

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:17.900
offset their emissions by

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:21.739
funding other clean energy projects.

00:08:21.739 --> 00:08:23.959
And if they find themselves not

00:08:23.959 --> 00:08:26.074
capable of doing any of this,

00:08:26.074 --> 00:08:27.800
of course, they'll have

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:30.150
to close their businesses.

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:36.559
We can create financial incentives for

00:08:36.559 --> 00:08:39.275
businesses to reduce their emissions

00:08:39.275 --> 00:08:41.990
by putting a price on carbon.

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:46.115
Emitting CO2 is not free anymore.

00:08:46.115 --> 00:08:48.665
If they emit ten tonnes of CO2,

00:08:48.665 --> 00:08:50.974
they have to pay for ten tonnes.

00:08:50.974 --> 00:08:53.105
But if they emit only five,

00:08:53.105 --> 00:08:55.430
they have to pay only for five.

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:56.989
If they want to reduce

00:08:56.989 --> 00:08:59.540
these five tonnes of CO2,

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:01.910
we help them with

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:05.300
market-based and other flexible approaches

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.955
to achieve this reduction.

00:09:07.955 --> 00:09:11.689
We will discuss two of such tools,

00:09:11.689 --> 00:09:14.944
Cap And Trade scheme and carbon tax.

00:09:14.944 --> 00:09:18.649
Cap And Trade allows businesses to

00:09:18.649 --> 00:09:20.330
reduce their emissions at

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:23.430
the lowest cost possible.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:31.710
The first question, of course, would be:

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.124
how does it work?

00:09:33.124 --> 00:09:34.482
What is a cap?

00:09:34.482 --> 00:09:35.840
If it's a trade,

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.339
there should be a market.

00:09:37.339 --> 00:09:39.809
If it's a market, who is the seller?

00:09:39.809 --> 00:09:40.969
Who is the buyer?

00:09:40.969 --> 00:09:43.800
And they sell or buy what?

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:49.715
Without going much into technicalities,

00:09:49.715 --> 00:09:53.105
we can try to answer all these questions

00:09:53.105 --> 00:09:54.229
with the help of

00:09:54.229 --> 00:09:57.005
a simple hypothetical scenario.

